---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects — GeoSmart" description="Metamorphic Petrology projects by Camila Fernández, covering regional metapelites, contact metamorphism and metabasite P–T evolution.">
  <section class="page-hero projects-hero">
    <div class="projects-topo" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Selected work</div>
      <h1>Projects</h1>
      <p class="muted">Academic and professional geology work focused on metamorphic interpretation, petrographic analysis and mineralogical evidence.</p>
      <div class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section projects-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="projects-intro"><span class="projects-count">03</span><p>Metamorphic Petrology · field, structural and petrographic studies</p></div>

      <div class="project-collection">
        <div class="collection-header">
          <div class="section-kicker">Collection</div>
          <h2>METAMORPHIC PETROLOGY</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="projects-grid collection-grid">
          <article class="card project-card project-regional">
            <div class="card-image regional-card"><span>01 / REGIONAL</span><i>◌</i><b>METAPELITES</b></div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-tag">Regional metamorphism · Structural geology</div>
              <h3>Regional Metamorphism of Metapelites</h3>
              <p>A field, structural and petrographic study of metamorphic rocks across the Somosierra–Hayedo de Montejo–Berzosa area. The report combines geological context, field observations, lithologies and deformation phases with mineralogical analysis in thin section.</p>
              <p>Metamorphic zonation, mineral assemblages and P–T relationships are used to interpret the tectonometamorphic evolution of the area, including the relationship between deformation, progressive metamorphism and later exhumation.</p>
              <ul class="project-tags">
                <li>Metamorphic petrology</li>
                <li>Field geology</li>
                <li>Structural geology</li>
                <li>Thin-section analysis</li>
                <li>Regional metamorphism</li>
                <li>P–T evolution</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="project-actions">
                <a class="btn" href="/documents/INFORME%201-2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View project</a>
                <a class="text-link dark" href="/documents/INFORME%201-2.pdf" download="Informe 1 - Metapelitas Regionales.pdf">Download PDF</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card project-card project-contact">
            <div class="card-image contact-card"><span>02 / CONTACT</span><i>◎</i><b>AUREOLE</b></div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-tag">Contact metamorphism · Petrography</div>
              <h3>Contact Metamorphism of Metapelites</h3>
              <p>A petrographic characterization of pelitic rocks affected by contact metamorphism around an intrusive body. Thin-section descriptions focus on mineral assemblages, protoliths, textures and the changes produced by increasing temperature toward the thermal source.</p>
              <p>The study interprets a low-pressure, high-temperature aureole using mineral stability and a petrogenetic grid, tracing spatial zonation from andalusite-bearing outer zones toward cordierite- and sillimanite-bearing inner zones.</p>
              <ul class="project-tags">
                <li>Metamorphic petrology</li>
                <li>Petrography</li>
                <li>Thin-section analysis</li>
                <li>Contact metamorphism</li>
                <li>Mineral assemblages</li>
                <li>Metamorphic zonation</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="project-actions">
                <a class="btn" href="/documents/Informe%202-2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View project</a>
                <a class="text-link dark" href="/documents/Informe%202-2.pdf" download="Informe 2 - Metapelitas de Contacto.pdf">Download PDF</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card project-card project-basic">
            <div class="card-image basic-card"><span>03 / BASIC</span><i>◈</i><b>METABASITES</b></div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-tag">Metabasites · P–T evolution</div>
              <h3>Metabasites: Petrography and P–T Evolution</h3>
              <p>A petrographic and metamorphic characterization of basic rocks through systematic thin-section study. The report identifies mineral assemblages, metamorphic textures, relics and retrograde features, then relates them to metamorphic facies and changing P–T conditions.</p>
              <p>The samples record a broad evolution from lower-grade greenschist conditions through amphibolite, blueschist, granulite and eclogite-related assemblages. Their comparison supports a prograde trajectory toward high pressure and temperature followed by partial retrogression during exhumation.</p>
              <ul class="project-tags">
                <li>Metamorphic petrology</li>
                <li>Petrography</li>
                <li>Thin-section analysis</li>
                <li>Metabasites</li>
                <li>Metamorphic facies</li>
                <li>P–T conditions</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="project-actions">
                <a class="btn" href="/documents/Informe%203.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View project</a>
                <a class="text-link dark" href="/documents/Informe%203.pdf" download="Informe 3 - Metabasitas.pdf">Download PDF</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-box project-cta">
        <div class="section-kicker">Research focus</div>
        <h2>Metamorphic petrology in practice.</h2>
        <p>These reports reflect the core tools of petrographic interpretation: thin-section observation, textural analysis, mineral assemblage identification and the construction of a coherent metamorphic history from mineralogical evidence.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="../contact/">Discuss this work →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.projects-hero{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;min-height:430px;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,42,43,.84) 0%,rgba(15,61,62,.62) 34%,rgba(15,61,62,.12) 72%,rgba(15,61,62,.05) 100%),url('/images/projects.png');background-position:center;background-size:cover}
.projects-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,42,43,.12),transparent 45%,rgba(7,42,43,.2))}
.projects-hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:5%;bottom:28px;width:120px;height:120px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,.08),0 0 0 28px rgba(245,130,32,.18);opacity:.7}
.projects-hero .container{position:relative;z-index:1}
.projects-hero .section-kicker{color:#f6c28f}
.projects-hero h1{color:#fff}
.projects-hero .muted{max-width:600px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86)}
.projects-hero .hero-rule span{background:#f6c28f}
.projects-topo{position:absolute;left:-30px;bottom:18px;width:430px;height:150px;opacity:.12;transform:rotate(-4deg)}
.projects-topo span{position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:48% 52% 45% 55%;transform:rotate(var(--r)) scale(var(--s))}
.projects-topo span:nth-child(1){--r:3deg;--s:.98}.projects-topo span:nth-child(2){--r:-2deg;--s:.82}.projects-topo span:nth-child(3){--r:4deg;--s:.65}.projects-topo span:nth-child(4){--r:-4deg;--s:.48}.projects-topo span:nth-child(5){--r:2deg;--s:.3}
.hero-rule{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-top:34px;align-items:center}
.hero-rule span{display:block;height:3px;background:var(--orange)}
.hero-rule span:nth-child(1){width:70px}.hero-rule span:nth-child(2){width:18px;opacity:.55}.hero-rule span:nth-child(3){width:7px;opacity:.3}
.projects-intro{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin:0 0 28px;color:#69706d;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}
.projects-count{color:var(--orange);font:600 2.4rem/1 'Playfair Display',serif}

.project-collection{margin-top:24px}
.collection-header{margin:0 0 26px}
.collection-header h2{color:var(--green);font:600 clamp(2.1rem,4vw,3.2rem)/1.08 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:10px 0 0}

.projects-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:stretch}
.card{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--white);transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease,border-color .25s ease}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(15,61,62,.08);border-color:rgba(245,130,32,.35)}
.project-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-top:4px solid var(--orange);border-radius:0 28px 0 28px;background:var(--white)}
.project-card:nth-child(2){border-top-color:var(--green)}
.project-card:nth-child(3){border-top-color:#b69b55}
.project-card .card-image{height:205px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:rgba(255,255,255,.84);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em}
.project-card .card-image::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.08),rgba(0,0,0,.25));pointer-events:none}
.project-card .card-image span,.project-card .card-image i,.project-card .card-image b{position:relative;z-index:1}
.project-card .card-image i{font-style:normal;margin:0 8px 0 4px;font-size:1.2rem}
.project-card .card-image b{display:block;font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)}
.regional-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#122f30 0%,#0f3d3e 40%,#f58220 41%,#d38d52 100%)}
.contact-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a4747 0%,#2a615b 36%,#d7a15f 37%,#f2dfc9 100%)}
.basic-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f3d3e 0%,#214d4e 46%,#b9a06d 47%,#e8dcc6 100%)}
.card-body{padding:28px 26px 24px}
.card-tag{color:var(--orange);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.card h3{color:var(--green);font:600 1.7rem/1.08 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:10px 0 12px}
.card p{color:#59615e;font-size:.9rem;margin:0 0 12px}
.project-tags{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:18px 0 0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.project-tags li{padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid rgba(15,61,62,.14);background:rgba(246,239,231,.65);color:var(--green);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.project-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}
.project-actions .btn,.project-actions .text-link {margin-top:0}
.project-cta{margin-top:100px;border-radius:0 34px 0 34px;padding:50px 55px}
.project-cta h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem)}

@media(max-width:800px){
  .projects-page::before{display:none}
  .projects-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .project-card .card-image{height:190px}
  .project-cta{margin-top:55px;padding:32px 22px}
  .projects-count{font-size:3rem}
  .project-actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  .project-actions .btn,.project-actions .text-link{width:auto}
}
</style>
